00:00:39.475 --> 00:00:41.555
Good job guys! Keep breathing.

00:00:43.054 --> 00:00:44.334
Three, two, one...

00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:46.024
Great!

00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:48.440
